*Heading
abq2ccx validation: two orthotropic blocks on uneven meshes, tied face to face by the deck's
own *EQUATIONs u_b - u_a = 0 (one per interface node pair and DOF), block A held at its
bottom, block B loaded obliquely at its top.  validate_with_ccx.py writes the equations
with repeated terms and in the local axes of a *TRANSFORM on block A's face nodes, which
must give the same displacements.
